<title>COLOMBIA: Colombia's Cementos Boyaca Q1 net up 56 pct.</title>
<headline>Colombia's Cementos Boyaca Q1 net up 56 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOGOTA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first quarter net profit of Colombian cement manufacturer Cementos Boyaca SA, a holding of Switzerland's giant Holderbank Financiere Glarus AG, rose 56 percent over the same  period last year, the Securities Superintendency said.</p>
<p>It said Boyaca's net profit totalled 2.73 billion pesos, against 1.75 billion a year ago.</p>
<p>Boyaca's assets were also up sharply, from 178.9 billion pesos in the first quarter of 1996 to 215.16 billion on March 31, 1997, the superintendency said.</p>
<p>(( -- Javier Mozzo, Bogota newsroom, 571 610 7944))</p>
